  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium 365\n\t\tCapium 365 (Customer/Client)\n\n### How to Accept the Accountant’s Invitation to Join Capium 365\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 25 Jul, 2025 at  4:50 PM\n\n\t\tCapium 365 :The Capium 365 client invitation acceptance feature allows clients to easily join the platform by accepting the secure invite sent by their accountant. This ensures a smooth onboarding experience, giving clients access to their personalised portal for real-time collaboration and improving overall communication and service delivery.\n\nNavigation > Capium 365 > Manage > Clients  > Send Invitation\n\nAn invitation email will then be sent to the client. And upon clicking on the Accept invitation it will redirect to Capium365 login and update Verification code. \n\nPlease refer the below screenshot:\n\nOnce verified, their Capium 365 account will be fully active and ready to use. \n\nCapium 365: How to log in to Capium 365?\n\nLink https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000270038?portalId=9000044273\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000118596\">Capium 365</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000201790\">Capium 365 (Customer/Client)</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to Accept the Accountant’s Invitation to Join Capium 365\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 25 Jul, 2025 at  4:50 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-end=\"129\" data-start=\"115\" dir=\"ltr\">Capium 365 :</strong>The Capium 365 client invitation acceptance feature allows clients to easily join the platform by accepting the secure invite sent by their accountant. This ensures a smooth onboarding experience, giving clients access to their personalised portal for real-time collaboration and improving overall communication and service delivery.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Navigation &gt; <span class=\"TextRun SCXW153760591 BCX0\" data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; line-height: 21.85px;\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW153760591 BCX0\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;;\">Capium 365 &gt; Manage &gt; Clients&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"EOP SCXW153760591 BCX0\" data-ccp-props=\"{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559738&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; line-height: 21.85px;\">&nbsp;&gt; Send Invitation</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">An invitation email will then be sent to the client. And upon clicking on the Accept invitation it will redirect to Capium365 login and update Verification code.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Please refer the below screenshot:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234643145/original/qhAq80Fb2eaM4D4dUf1P590V7quIg5NoCw.png?1753355239\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234643145\"></span></p><p><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9234643244/original/-bpFrIutJztcSzh8g-xXPufK74iQh9eAhg.png?1753355449\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9234643244\"></p><p><span class=\"TextRun SCXW153760591 BCX0\" data-contrast=\"auto\" lang=\"EN-GB\" style=